    title: "go os/exec LookPath and CommandContext are rowed subprocess and net/http NewRequest is rowed net_send, but all three only stat paths or fill structs -- the already-swept constructor family surviving in the remainder"  # 4b1c
    status: violated  # 4b1c
    priority: 3  # 4b1c
    parent:  # 4b1c
    tags:  # 4b1c
    - catalogue  # 4b1c
